==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 40~80 seconds<sup>1,200f~2,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 60~120 seconds<sup>1,800f~3,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Ultimate Bondage Cat (Enemy)|Ultimate Bondage Cat]] spawns after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*1 [[Ultimate Bondage Cat (Enemy)|Ultimate Bondage Cat]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Ultimate Bondage Cat (Enemy)|Ultimate Bondage Cat]] spawns after 116.67 seconds<sup>3,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Ultimate Bondage Cat (Enemy)|Ultimate Bondage Cat]] spawns after 170 seconds<sup>5,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Ultimate Bondage Cat (Enemy)|Ultimate Bondage Cat]] spawns after 220 seconds<sup>6,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Ultimate Bondage Cat (Enemy)|Ultimate Bondage Cat]] spawns after 266.67 seconds<sup>8,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ultimate Bondage Cat (Enemy)|Ultimate Bondage Cats]] spawn after 310 seconds<sup>9,300f</sup>, delay 80~100 seconds<sup>2,400f~3,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**1 [[Ultimate Bondage Cat (Enemy)|Ultimate Bondage Cat]] spawns.
**1 [[Ultimate Bondage Cat (Enemy)|Ultimate Bondage Cat]] spawns.
**1 [[Ultimate Bondage Cat (Enemy)|Ultimate Bondage Cat]] spawns.

==Strategy==
The stage will first spawn an Ultimate Bondage Cat, and you need to kill it fast as the stage will continuously spawn them along with the other enemies, alternating between one Otta-smack-u and one St. Pigge the 2nd. Three additional Ultimate Bondage Cats will emerge from the enemy base when its health falls below 50%.

[[True Form]]s are highly recommended, with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] as a main means of damaging the swarm of Ultimate Bondage Cats and with [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] as support. The Ultimate Bondage Cats have a mere 320 range - enough to be outranged by [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], ([[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed]]) [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats]] and most [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cats]].

Money is very scarce on this stage, and the bondage cats will shred any front liners you have, so it is good to use 3-4 75¢ meat shields together with backliners.

